         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nThis game practices the ideas from the text *Reality* (<htcite0>). Before playing, read that text to see how decimal numbers fill the space between the integers we use for counting, and keep in mind the rule that tells which of two numbers is greater or smaller: the open side of the symbol always faces the larger number.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "3c038244-e808-4ad2-bc2a-4663cbfeae3d",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Reality",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "-1",
                        "day": "-1"
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
