            {
               "text": "<div class=\"htGreaterSmallerGame\"><span class=\"htGreaterSmallerLevel\" id=\"htRealCompareLevel\"></span><span class=\"htGreaterSmallerQuestion\" id=\"htRealCompareQuestion\">Are the numbers in order? Is B greater than A?</span><div class=\"htGreaterSmallerCards\"><div class=\"htGreaterSmallerCard\"><span class=\"htGreaterSmallerLabel\">A</span><span class=\"htGreaterSmallerValue text_to_paint\" id=\"htRealCompareLeft\">0</span></div><span class=\"htGreaterSmallerOp\" id=\"htRealCompareOp\">&lt;</span><div class=\"htGreaterSmallerCard\"><span class=\"htGreaterSmallerLabel\">B</span><span class=\"htGreaterSmallerValue text_to_paint\" id=\"htRealCompareRight\">1</span></div></div><div class=\"htGreaterSmallerButtonsRow\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"htRealCompareInBtn\" class=\"htGreaterSmallerButton\">In order</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"htRealCompareNotBtn\" class=\"htGreaterSmallerButton\">Not in order</button></div><div class=\"htGreaterSmallerFeedback\" id=\"htRealCompareFeedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"htGreaterSmallerNextContainer\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"htRealCompareNewBtn\" class=\"reset-tutor-btn\">🎲 New exercise</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"htRealCompareNextBtn\" class=\"reset-tutor-btn hidden\">Next level</button></div><span id=\"htRealCompareLevelTemplate\" class=\"htGreaterSmallerHidden\">Level {n} of 4</span><span id=\"htRealCompareMsgCorrect\" class=\"htGreaterSmallerHidden\">🎉 Congratulations! Number {big} is bigger than {small} ({small} < {big}).</span><span id=\"htRealCompareMsgCorrectMuch\" class=\"htGreaterSmallerHidden\">🎉 Congratulations! Number {big} is much bigger than {small} ({big} ≫ {small}).</span><span id=\"htRealCompareMsgWrong\" class=\"htGreaterSmallerHidden\">Let us remember: The number {small} is smaller than number {big}. ({small} < {big}).</span><span id=\"htRealCompareMsgWrongMuch\" class=\"htGreaterSmallerHidden\">Let us remember: The number {small} is much smaller than number {big}. ({small} ≪ {big}).</span><span id=\"htRealCompareMsgFinal\" class=\"htGreaterSmallerHidden\">🎉🎉🎉 Congratulations! You completed all the levels! 🎉🎉🎉</span><span id=\"htRealComparePlayAgain\" class=\"htGreaterSmallerHidden\">Play again</span><span id=\"htRealCompareNextLabel\" class=\"htGreaterSmallerHidden\">Next level</span></div>",
